    "detailed_description": "<h1>Lust Theory - Season 3</h1><p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The highly anticipated Lust Theory Season 3 is now available for WISHLIST!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/7d23675caf13a5062a1ed34df19c5de9.avif?t=1754077659\" width=600 height=338 /></span>We're excited to finally announce that Lovense, the creators of some seriously cool toys, are teaming up with Unreal Lust Theory! When you start a scene with the girls, you'll feel like you're right there with them, experiencing everything in real-time! Get your toy from our link inside the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/d44dd7f998b8cc53f27141eb560282b4.avif?t=1754077659\" width=600 height=90 /></span>Be the part of this game development! Your feedback and participation is most valuable in creating the Unreal Lust Theory world! Tell us what you think, test out the mechanics and sex scenes, and with your help expect more and MORE to come! Please keep in mind that this is a <strong>Early access</strong> game more content is coming soon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/3127d19ebbfd9e65892aa36a51e38a13.poster.avif?t=1754077659\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/3127d19ebbfd9e65892aa36a51e38a13.webm?t=1754077659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/3127d19ebbfd9e65892aa36a51e38a13.mp4?t=1754077659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/85eeb716212cf24e5b08eaf2d4ec0597.avif?t=1754077659\" width=600 height=90 /></span>Dive into a captivating virtual realm where fantasies come alive in &quot;Unreal Lust Theory&quot;. Designed for the sophisticated gamer seeking thrilling adventures, this game offers an enticing blend of interactive storytelling and immersive gameplay that caters to your every need. Use the drone in sex scenes to get the best angle you desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/614338bd4a01be658c01990efb14955a.poster.avif?t=1754077659\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/614338bd4a01be658c01990efb14955a.webm?t=1754077659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/614338bd4a01be658c01990efb14955a.mp4?t=1754077659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/f4baad5851c67eb69cd88acbde5e75cc.avif?t=1754077659\" width=600 height=90 /></span>Based on the original AVN &quot;Lust Theory,&quot; this game masterfully blends sensuality and storytelling, providing an experience that resonates with your refined tastes. Prepare to be swept away by a narrative that delves into the deepest recesses of desire, all within a captivating virtual realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/f0f5c5b3e32f74d82a29fe38d2e4943e.poster.avif?t=1754077659\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/f0f5c5b3e32f74d82a29fe38d2e4943e.webm?t=1754077659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/f0f5c5b3e32f74d82a29fe38d2e4943e.mp4?t=1754077659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/f6cf5449093b65bb075885fcb8c217c2.avif?t=1754077659\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/49a3ea95d8c2a2a95b0498bc8ad46b02.poster.avif?t=1754077659\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/49a3ea95d8c2a2a95b0498bc8ad46b02.webm?t=1754077659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573100/extras/49a3ea95d8c2a2a95b0498bc8ad46b02.mp4?t=1754077659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FULL VOICE-OVER (for all female characters)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free Roam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In-game Hint System (Quest Journal)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Define Your Own Relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;Lust Time&quot; (interactive sex scenes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sound Effects for Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Different time of the day</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for ADULTS only and it includes explicit, sexual content that some viewers may find offensive. The characters shown in the game are all over 18 years old.</p>",
